{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56862","headline":"扬州民爲杜亚诵（题拟） 二 · 佚名","name":"扬州民爲杜亚诵（题拟） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沔彼流水，我邦是纪，锺美不知。\n（都人诵。\n均见《文苑英华》卷八一二梁肃《通爱敬陂水门记》引）（按：贞元四年，杜亚爲扬州牧，疏濬邘沟，通爱敬陂，事峻，甚便农商，州民爲之作诵。\n梁肃文述其事甚详，兹不具录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56862.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56862","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}